      "notes": "Verbatim short quote from Playbooks listing per source."
    },
    {
      "id": "C-0048",
      "text": "If the loaded spec contains sensitive endpoint paths or examples (real customer IDs, internal-only URLs), those become visible to the LLM via the mcp-openapi-schema server.",
      "source_uri": "/workspaces/feature-pipeline/working/feature/devcontainer-mcp-provisioning-r1/research-notes/T-002-mcp-openapi-schema.md",
      "source_type": "community_blog",
      "source_provenance": "internal",
      "assumed_substrate": "generic",
      "date": "2026-05-23",
      "entities": [],
      "confidence": "high",
      "notes": null
    },
    {
      "id": "C-0049",
      "text": "Only one version (0.0.1) of mcp-openapi-schema has been published.",
      "source_uri": "/workspaces/feature-pipeline/working/feature/devcontainer-mcp-provisioning-r1/research-notes/T-002-mcp-openapi-schema.md",
      "source_type": "community_blog",
      "source_provenance": "internal",
      "assumed_substrate": "generic",
      "date": "2026-05-23",
      "entities": [],
      "confidence": "high",
      "notes": null
    },
    {
      "id": "C-0050",
      "text": "`npx -y mcp-openapi-schema` will resolve to whatever is 'latest' at the moment of invocation.",
      "source_uri": "/workspaces/feature-pipeline/working/feature/devcontainer-mcp-provisioning-r1/research-notes/T-002-mcp-openapi-schema.md",
      "source_type": "community_blog",
      "source_provenance": "internal",
      "assumed_substrate": "generic",
      "date": "2026-05-23",
      "entities": [],
      "confidence": "high",
      "notes": null
    },
    {
      "id": "C-0051",
      "text": "For reproducible devcontainer provisioning, pin the mcp-openapi-schema version explicitly: `npx -y mcp-openapi-schema@0.0.1 …`.",
      "source_uri": "/workspaces/feature-pipeline/working/feature/devcontainer-mcp-provisioning-r1/research-notes/T-002-mcp-openapi-schema.md",
      "source_type": "community_blog",
      "source_provenance": "internal",
      "assumed_substrate": "generic",
      "date": "2026-05-23",
      "entities": [],
      "confidence": "high",
      "notes": null
    },
    {
      "id": "C-0052",
      "text": "The pre-1.0 version number of mcp-openapi-schema signals that breaking changes may land without semver protection in any future release.",
      "source_uri": "/workspaces/feature-pipeline/working/feature/devcontainer-mcp-provisioning-r1/research-notes/T-002-mcp-openapi-schema.md",
      "source_type": "community_blog",
      "source_provenance": "internal",
      "assumed_substrate": "generic",
      "date": "2026-05-23",
      "entities": [],
      "confidence": "medium",
      "notes": "Source rates F-6 medium-confidence (pinning recommendation is researcher synthesis)."
    },
    {
      "id": "C-0053",
      "text": "If mcp-openapi-schema remains unmaintained, a pinned 0.0.1 will eventually develop CVE exposure via its transitive deps (notably js-yaml, swagger-parser).",
      "source_uri": "/workspaces/feature-pipeline/working/feature/devcontainer-mcp-provisioning-r1/research-notes/T-002-mcp-openapi-schema.md",
      "source_type": "community_blog",
      "source_provenance": "internal",
      "assumed_substrate": "generic",
      "date": "2026-05-23",
      "entities": [],
      "confidence": "medium",
      "notes": null
    },
    {
      "id": "C-0054",
      "text": "The devcontainer should treat MCP server packages as periodic-review supply-chain dependencies.",
      "source_uri": "/workspaces/feature-pipeline/working/feature/devcontainer-mcp-provisioning-r1/research-notes/T-002-mcp-openapi-schema.md",
      "source_type": "community_blog",
      "source_provenance": "internal",
      "assumed_substrate": "generic",
      "date": "2026-05-23",
      "entities": [],
      "confidence": "medium",
      "notes": null
    },
    {
      "id": "C-0055",
      "text": "Stdio is the canonical local-devcontainer MCP transport — no HTTP listener, no port to manage, no auth surface.",
      "source_uri": "/workspaces/feature-pipeline/working/feature/devcontainer-mcp-provisioning-r1/research-notes/T-002-mcp-openapi-schema.md",
      "source_type": "community_blog",
      "source_provenance": "internal",
      "assumed_substrate": "generic",
      "date": "2026-05-23",
      "entities": [],
      "confidence": "high",
      "notes": null
    },
    {
      "id": "C-0056",
      "text": "The mcp-openapi-schema tool surface is entirely schema-inspection; there is no attack path where an LLM call mutates a remote system through this server.",
      "source_uri": "/workspaces/feature-pipeline/working/feature/devcontainer-mcp-provisioning-r1/research-notes/T-002-mcp-openapi-schema.md",
      "source_type": "community_blog",
      "source_provenance": "internal",
      "assumed_substrate": "generic",
      "date": "2026-05-23",
      "entities": [],
      "confidence": "high",
      "notes": null
    },
    {
      "id": "C-0057",
      "text": "No secret needs to live in the devcontainer image or in .mcp.json for the mcp-openapi-schema server.",
      "source_uri": "/workspaces/feature-pipeline/working/feature/devcontainer-mcp-provisioning-r1/research-notes/T-002-mcp-openapi-schema.md",
      "source_type": "community_blog",
      "source_provenance": "internal",
      "assumed_substrate": "generic",
      "date": "2026-05-23",
      "entities": [],
      "confidence": "high",
      "notes": null
    },
    {
      "id": "C-0058",
      "text": "Adding the Node devcontainer feature is a one-line addition but is a real dependency that must be tracked.",
      "source_uri": "/workspaces/feature-pipeline/working/feature/devcontainer-mcp-provisioning-r1/research-notes/T-002-mcp-openapi-schema.md",
      "source_type": "community_blog",
      "source_provenance": "internal",
      "assumed_substrate": "generic",
      "date": "2026-05-23",
      "entities": [],
      "confidence": "high",
      "notes": null
    },
    {
      "id": "C-0059",
      "text": "The dominant risk for mcp-openapi-schema is project maintenance: a single 0.0.1 release from March 2025 with no follow-ups.",
      "source_uri": "/workspaces/feature-pipeline/working/feature/devcontainer-mcp-provisioning-r1/research-notes/T-002-mcp-openapi-schema.md",
      "source_type": "community_blog",
      "source_provenance": "internal",
      "assumed_substrate": "generic",
      "date": "2026-05-23",
      "entities": [],
      "confidence": "high",
      "notes": null
    },
    {
      "id": "C-0060",
      "text": "Mitigation option: pin @0.0.1 and accept that a periodic supply-chain review is required.",
      "source_uri": "/workspaces/feature-pipeline/working/feature/devcontainer-mcp-provisioning-r1/research-notes/T-002-mcp-openapi-schema.md",
      "source_type": "community_blog",
      "source_provenance": "internal",
      "assumed_substrate": "generic",
      "date": "2026-05-23",
      "entities": [],
      "confidence": "medium",
      "notes": null
    },
    {
      "id": "C-0061",
      "text": "Mitigation option: fork mcp-openapi-schema to an org-owned mirror if longer-term reliance is anticipated.",
      "source_uri": "/workspaces/feature-pipeline/working/feature/devcontainer-mcp-provisioning-r1/research-notes/T-002-mcp-openapi-schema.md",
      "source_type": "community_blog",
      "source_provenance": "internal",
